   "protocol": "The same turns through the SDK's chain (alkove.Chain: Focus then Cue), its own pauses and `turn` reads; a turn is cut off when a word starts after an end, its latency runs from the end of its last word to the first end after it (input clock: Focus adds 16 ms in real time). Smart Turn v3.2 as Pipecat runs it, read once 0.2 s into each of the same pauses, else the end after 3 s of silence. Mean of the 7 languages, each language under `languages`.",
   "metrics": {
    "cut_pct": "turns cut off, %",
    "median_ms": "median latency, ms",
    "p90_ms": "90th percentile of latency, ms"
   },
